864
00:45:48.621 --> 00:45:50.914
<i>Pastikan untuk menemui kami
di atap tepat pada saat kedatangan.</i>

865
00:45:50.915 --> 00:45:52.249
<i>- Bersiaplah.</i>
- Iya.

866
00:45:52.250 --> 00:45:53.500
[drum dipukul]

867
00:45:53.501 --> 00:45:56.503
Pada siang hari,
helikopter pasokan akan tiba.

868
00:45:56.504 --> 00:45:57.797
- Apa?
- [Soo-jeong] Hmm?

869
00:45:58.298 --> 00:46:00.799
[Tae-hwa] Pertama kali
kami punya heli di kompleks,

870
00:46:00.800 --> 00:46:02.468
tapi jika kita terus mengatasinya,

871
00:46:02.469 --> 00:46:04.344
- kita harus bisa mengatasinya.
- Sial, kawan.

872
00:46:04.345 --> 00:46:06.263
[Tae-hwa] Ingat keselamatan dulu.

873
00:46:06.264 --> 00:46:08.056
Semua orang tetap waspada.

874
00:46:08.057 --> 00:46:09.183
Bersiaplah untuk apa pun.

875
00:46:09.184 --> 00:46:10.935
- Baiklah?
- [semua] Ya, Pak

876
00:46:11.728 --> 00:46:14.480
[Tae-hwa] Mulai sekarang,
biarkan baju besimu tetap menyala setiap saat.

877
00:46:14.481 --> 00:46:17.900
Gye-young, ambil baju besi lagi.
Soo-Jeong harus memakainya juga.

878
00:46:17.901 --> 00:46:19.568
Ya, tuan!

879
00:46:19.569 --> 00:46:20.694
Terima kasih tuan!

880
00:46:20.695 --> 00:46:22.280
[menghela nafas dan mendengus]

881
00:46:23.072 --> 00:46:23.948
[terkekeh]

882
00:46:25.575 --> 00:46:27.285
[menghela nafas dan mengerang]

883
00:46:30.497 --> 00:46:32.040
[musik militer diputar]

884
00:46:36.377 --> 00:46:39.589
[prajurit] Opera, ini Eagle One.
Mendekati rooftop sekarang.

885
00:46:41.716 --> 00:46:43.009
[helikopter melayang]

886
00:46:44.260 --> 00:46:45.303
<i>Menjatuhkannya.</i>

887
00:46:47.805 --> 00:46:49.848
[Gye-young] Oh, ayolah. Ayo cepat.

888
00:46:49.849 --> 00:46:51.725
[Soo-jeong] Itu datang. Itu akan datang.

889
00:46:51.726 --> 00:46:54.102
[Kyung-sik] Ini Opera, Opera.
Ikan, tanggapi.

890
00:46:54.103 --> 00:46:55.939
Tidak bisakah benda itu membawaku pulang?

891
00:46:57.649 --> 00:46:59.608
- Mereka bisa melakukan itu?
- [Gye-young] Haruskah aku bertanya?

892
00:46:59.609 --> 00:47:02.237
Ini Opera, Opera. Ikan, tanggapi.

893
00:47:14.249 --> 00:47:16.084
[musik muram diputar]

